The Volkswagen Transporter T6.1 T30 Trendline is a mid-range trim level of VW's popular medium van, featuring a 3000kg Gross Vehicle Weight (GVW) for increased payload capacity compared to lower GVW models. It offers a step up in features and comfort compared to the base Startline trim, positioning it as a well-equipped workhorse or a comfortable base for conversions.

